<!-- ### Add-A-Page End -->

<p>Zach and I decided that, on future trips, we'll put in at Goldfields, where most
people leave; and that way the trip to Phon D. Sutton would be two hours at the most;
in addition, there are fewer people&mdash;on weekdays, very possibly none.</p>

<p>But even if I wind up horribly sunburned tomorrow (the jury is still out; I'm reddish
but more ruddy than red so I may not have lost <i>all</i> of my base tan!) it will
have been so worth it for such a wonderful day.</p>


